*.pyc
.env
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
# The ingestion output is tracked: chunks.jsonl is the corpus every chunk id,
# gold citation and run file refers to, and its hash is the index version.
# The index itself (data/processed/index/) is rebuilt from it.
